<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C SEPT NET FLAT AT PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C SEPT NET FLAT AT PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.06 vs   2.05</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.52 vs   3.00</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.68 vs   2.96</p>
<p> Sales		   27.06 vs  25.17</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    17.19 vs  15.29</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	31.63 vs  24.86</p>
<p> Operating profit    33.64 vs  24.73</p>
<p> Sales		  241.16 vs 202.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Cieszyn</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
